    "html": "<p>A block moving with initial speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> is brought to rest, after travelling a distance d, by a frictional force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span> . A second identical block moving with initial speed u is brought to rest in the same distance d by a frictional force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{f}{2}\"></span>. What is u?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{4}\"></span></li></ol>"
